{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id469036602"}, "name":{"label":"Andrei Baritchi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-13T10:30:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10030122114"}, "title":{"label":"10/10 App! I would like to recommend one feature:"}, "content":{"label":"The option to use critical alerts if i haven’t interacted with the alert at the start of a task. For example, I toggled the critical alert feature on the MediSafe app where i get notifications with sound and vibration if i haven’t marked my medication in the first 30 minutes, regardless of my focus mode. \n\nIntroducing this feature into Structured would be a great help, as i have a series of exams in two weeks and i can’t afford to miss out on the tight schedule i set for myself. \n\nI realise it might take a while to implement if you decide to do so, but i will keep having exams for years to come and this feature would definitely come in handy!\n\nThanks for a great app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id911112448"}, "name":{"label":"Jamilah Theresine"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-11T07:18:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10022746675"}, "title":{"label":"Never running out of time!"}, "content":{"label":"Love, love, love this product. I have always juggled many things on my plate, now that I have just starting studying and also having a back injury I have even more appointments and classes I need to plan into my day. I discovered this amazing planner at the perfect time in my life right now!!! Keep up the good work", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
