{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id107196399"}, "name":{"label":"JaMiE1515"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-06T14:42:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10006539848"}, "title":{"label":"So good! Happily paid the lifetime subscription"}, "content":{"label":"This is by far the best planning app… I use this for literally entire life because I use a block schedule system and this app is perfect for that. I no longer forget birthdays, appointments… I also love the “all day” setting which is pinned to the top - I use this for the things I do everyday and I can check them off the list. I especially love how customisable it is.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id17613134"}, "name":{"label":"LucyLilitu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-05T05:48:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10001673855"}, "title":{"label":"No auto-schedular"}, "content":{"label":"What would be nice is a way to auto-reschedule all old tasks.\n\nI miss tasks often and would like a way to reschedule these tasks. The AI thing is cool but I am having trouble with missed tasks days or weeks old.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1469782418"}, "name":{"label":"unknownvenus999"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-03T20:25:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"9996948894"}, "title":{"label":"Extremely Manageable and Reliable"}, "content":{"label":"It's easy to use, efficient, it guides you through the app and has a lot of different customisation options and not just for the aesthetic. You have all sorts of different options to pick from when creating tasks/plans for your day(s) and it even takes into consideration your wake-up and sleep times. Amazing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id108109852"}, "name":{"label":"KrysGaddes"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-02T15:05:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"9992696434"}, "title":{"label":"Finally - an app that works for me!"}, "content":{"label":"I have ADHD, and have been looking for a way to digitally plan for SO long. I love physical planning too but once I get overwhelmed, I ‘fall off the wagon’. This is beautiful. It ties together my calendar and reminders and displays them in one place. It’s so easy to create tasks for the day, with sub tasks, and it just WORKS. My brain gets it. And I’ve kept using it - consistently - every day - for 3 months at this point. I knew the first day I used it that this was the app I needed. Bought the lifetime subscription. Can’t speak highly enough.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id535007732"}, "name":{"label":"Hunter.Cox"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-01T15:20:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1"}, "id":{"label":"9989176339"}, "title":{"label":"App is great, however is laggy and crashes"}, "content":{"label":"My experience with this app for the first 3 weeks has been exceptional, such a great app. However I have experienced extreme lagging and crashing. The app now when I create new schedules and duplicates just freezes and glitches out… I have an Iphone 12 Pro and couldn’t imagine it would be caused by my phone. Please let me know if there’s anything I can do to resolve this issue. thanks", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
